      "content": "the bells haven't stopped ringing for hours. it feels like the whole world is just... waiting for the end. i look at the gates and i just feel nothing. no drive to fight, no fear, just this heavy weight saying it's already over. do you ever feel like fighting is just a way to prolong the agony? like there's no real point in trying to survive something that's clearly meant to end?",
